Widening load witness: K=64, M=1 satisfies K*M=128/2, and align=offset=0
passes Memarg_ok. At address 0 in a one-page memory vload-pack-oob is false;
vload-pack-val would require an integer lane of width 128. None exists.
The binary productions for widening loads are 0xfd subopcodes 1 through 6.

